//! The `grid-auto-rows` [CSS](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS) property specifies
//! the size of an implicitly-created grid row `track` or pattern of tracks.
//!
//! Initial: auto. Inherited: no.
//! Percentages: refer to corresponding dimension of the content area.
